Also, (especially for the 386 w/ 2 Megs cause that's what I have)
I use a separate boot disk (I have four handy at all times
one sound and cd, one cd only, one sound only, one "clean")
and I have all of my "spare" memory as a disk cache.

so my config.sys looks like:

device=c:\dos\himem.sys
dos=high,umb
devicehigh=c:\dos\ansi.sys
devicehigh=c:\dos\smartdrv.sys 1024


